  "prefLabel": "Phy 401.15 Physical therapy aide",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 401.15 “Physical therapy aide” means “Physical therapy aide” as defined in RSA 328-A:2, X, namely, “a support person trained under the direction of a physical therapist who performs designated and supervised routine tasks related to physical therapy.”\n\nSource. #9456, eff 4-17-09; renumbered by #10061 (from Phy 401.13); ss by #12088, eff 1-20-17; renumbered by #13825 (formerly Phy 401.16)",
